"observations":[
{"id":"S03-O1","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/name","/categories/M3/moa","/categories/M3/adverse_effects"],"text":"name 은 'PLLA/CaHA/PDLLA/PCL' 네 재질을 '/' 로 나열하지만 진술 5개는 모두 PLLA 주어. CaHA 는 moa/2 에서 비교 대상('mechanotransductive mechanism of CaHA')으로만, PDLLA·PCL 은 진술에 없음."},
{"id":"S03-O2","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/moa/0/statement","/categories/M3/moa/2/statement"],"text":"moa/0 과 moa/2 는 거의 같은 문장(mechanisms↔pathways, 'distinct from mechanotransductive pathways' ↔ 'distinct from the mechanotransductive mechanism of CaHA'). 같은 서지. 중복 진술 여부는 후속 판단."},
{"id":"S03-O3","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/moa/1/statement","/categories/M3/moa/3/statement"],"text":"moa/1·moa/3 도 IL1-α, IL1-β, CXCL6 upregulation → dermal thickening 을 반복. moa/1 은 'PLLA microspheres with heterogeneous, flake-like particle morphology' — 'microspheres'(구형)와 'flake-like'(판상)가 한 구에 함께 있음."},
{"id":"S03-O4","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/moa/0/statement","/categories/M3/moa/1/statement","/categories/M3/moa/2/statement","/categories/M3/moa/3/statement","/categories/M3/adverse_effects/0/statement"],"text":"이 구획의 statement 5개는 모두 마침표 없이 끝난다(다른 구획 다수는 마침표로 끝남). 형식 관찰."},
{"id":"S03-O5","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/adverse_effects/0/statement"],"text":"부작용 진술은 사건 대신 'may result in greater macrophage activation compared to uniform spherical particles of other biostimulators' — 가능성+비교. 무엇이 임상적 부작용인지는 원문에 없다."},
{"id":"S03-O6","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/moa/0/patient_en","/categories/M3/moa/1/patient_en","/categories/M3/moa/2/patient_en","/categories/M3/moa/3/patient_en"],"text":"patient_en/zh/ja 는 PLLA·대식세포·IL 유전자 등 고유 명칭을 모두 빼고 'The product'·'Special micro-particles'·'natural defense systems' 로 일반화. moa/1 patient_en 은 statement 의 'pronounced inflammatory response' 를 'encouraging its natural structure' 로 바꿈."},
{"id":"S03-O7","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/moa/3/patient_ko"],"text":"patient_ko 표기 '폴리엘엘락산'(moa/3)과 'PLLA'(나머지) 혼용."},
{"id":"S03-O8","status":"P","pointers":["/categories/M3/effects"],"text":"effects 는 빈 배열."}
],
